Lastname_0819_03. Create the flowchart and java code that determines the profit on any car sold. The
program prompts the sales manager to enter the car’s sale price and actual purchase price for a car.
Calculate and display the profit, which is the sale price minus the purchase price. Also, before the
program ends display the phrase “Thank you for using this program”.

import java.util.*;
public class Baban_0819_03{
    public static void main(String args[]){
        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);
        double sale, actual, profit;

        System.out.print("Enter the sale price: ");
        sale = input.nextInt();
        System.out.print("Enter the purchase price: ");
        actual = input.nextInt();

        profit = sale - actual;

        System.out.println("Your profit is " + profit + ".");
        System.out.println("Thank you for using this program.");

    }
}
